      "text": "简化代码演示 运行 toy 握手 // 极简演示：只展示“双方算出同一个共享秘密”的核心想法 // 真实 TLS 1.3: X25519/P-256 ECDHE + HKDF + 证书链 + Finished + AEAD const p = 23; // toy prime，真实 TLS 不会用这么小的数 const g = 5; // generator const clientPrivate = 6; const serverPrivate = 15; const clientPublic = modPow(g, clientPrivate, p); const serverPublic = modPow(g, serverPrivate, p); const clientShared = modPow(serverPublic, clientPrivate, p); const serverShared = modPow(clientPublic, serverPrivate, p); console.log({ clientPublic, serverPublic }); console.log(clientShared === serverShared); // true function modPow(base, exp, mod) { let result = 1;",
